-- v4.1.1 FIX (probed this turn): PlayerGui.CustomerSpeechUI.Adornee reads **nil** in this VM,
--   so the old speechList() could never identify a customer - every Seat/Order call sent
--   nothing. Customers are now read from Workspace.Tycoons.Tycoon.ClientCustomers, where the
--   group FOLDER NAME is GroupId and the child MODEL NAME is CustomerId (proven live:
--   Folder "14" -> Model "1", Model "2").
-- Also confirmed live: Surface=10 tables, bills=0, trash=0, food=0 when idle - so empty
-- collect loops are expected until customers actually sit and eat.
-- TaskCompleted is a plain RemoteEvent (index 3, only one) - the UnreplicatedEvent scare was
-- a garbled read, not real.
-- AutoRun defaults OFF. Use Report + the Test buttons; each prints OK/FAIL and why.
-- Upgrades excluded. No Instance.new. ClassName tests only (IsA is always true in Matcha).
-- Loader:
